I dug through the whole file (it's the single 858-line `TransferDesk.jsx` — no other source files in the repo) and traced every place a countdown or date-diff is computed. There's only one: `TransferDesk.jsx:702-710`.

```js
const countdown = useMemo(() => {
  const open = new Date('2026-06-15T00:00:00');
  const diff = open - now;
  if (diff <= 0) return 'WINDOW OPEN';
  const d = Math.floor(diff / 86400000);
  const h = Math.floor((diff % 86400000) / 3600000);
  return { d, h };
}, [now]);
```

and it's rendered at line 755:
```jsx
